# Single-choice questions

<Directive id="use-the-list">When the user must pick one of several options, ask through the list described here. Do not write the options in a normal reply.</Directive>

<AskOne id="how-to-ask" title="How to ask" />

## Example

For "Which database should I use?", offer `PostgreSQL (Recommended)`, `SQLite` and `MySQL`, each with one line saying when it fits best.
